• You are an SME on Global Mobility. You have Min. 6 years of experience working in similar roles, preferably in a fast-moving, ever-changing international environment

• You are an excellent communicator and have great stakeholder management skills, the ability to convey complex messages, and get buy-ins with leadership and senior stakeholders&nbsp;

• You are a team player. You love working with people and humbly enjoy taking part in their journey. You truly believe in the magic that happens when teams come together

• You are very well organized , pay great attention to detail , and can juggle multiple tasks at the same time&nbsp;

• You have LNS Mentality : You thrive outside of your comfort zone, live to learn new things, and enjoy variation during your working day

• You are data-driven and analytical, and can apply an analytical approach to your daily work, work with data, and take meaningful learnings from existing data&nbsp;

• You are fluent in English and German &nbsp;

